Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:19.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I was standing in the quiet watching shadows softly breathe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:25.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Those unspoken wishes like a mystery
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Every step feels bigger than but a crowd is all to me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.43,0:00:37.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know who is waiting there but I'll let it be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.69,0:00:40.94,Main,,0,0,0,,If I fall, I die before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.65,0:00:44.24,Main,,0,0,0,,If I break, let there be light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:47.11,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a world behind the fear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.11,0:00:50.27,Main,,0,0,0,,So it can make me feel alive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:53.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Seeing a storm start to avoid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:56.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Showing the miracle we made
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.31,0:00:59.27,Main,,0,0,0,,This time we're about to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:02.59,Main,,0,0,0,,No more fending, drifting by
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.59,0:01:05.02,Main,,0,0,0,,We keep moving
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.81,0:01:08.73,Main,,0,0,0,,We keep it when I'm standing still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.73,0:01:11.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not losing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.77,0:01:14.93,Main,,0,0,0,,You and your song we're writing still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.93,0:01:17.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Knowing the ending
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.85,0:01:20.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I know I don't need to see the proof
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.99,0:01:23.04,Main,,0,0,0,,The sign is lightening up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.04,0:01:26.10,Main,,0,0,0,,The sign is lightening up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:28.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Like he's calling me to you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:49.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I remember all the versions
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.47,0:01:52.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Some are lonely, some are ill or still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.51,0:01:55.59,Main,,0,0,0,,No more running away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.59,0:01:58.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Just hearing echoes afar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.25,0:02:01.08,Main,,0,0,0,,If the future is a puzzle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.47,0:02:04.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I am brave enough to solve it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.19,0:02:07.03,Main,,0,0,0,,If the end is just a journey
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.03,0:02:09.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be ready for the call
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.47,0:02:12.86,Main,,0,0,0,,If I fall, I can be far
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.29,0:02:15.89,Main,,0,0,0,,If I break, let there be light
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.89,0:02:18.83,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a world behind the fear
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.83,0:02:22.07,Main,,0,0,0,,So it can make me feel alive
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.07,0:02:24.94,Main,,0,0,0,,We keep moving
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.43,0:02:28.33,Main,,0,0,0,,We keep it when I'm standing still
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:31.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not losing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.23,0:02:34.15,Main,,0,0,0,,You left me somewhere right still
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.15,0:02:37.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Knowing the ending
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.23,0:02:40.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I know I don't need to see it through
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.41,0:02:42.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm silent right now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.47,0:02:44.85,Main,,0,0,0,,He's calling me to you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:47.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I can feel it pushing on me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.77,0:02:50.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Up when the sky, he falls on top of me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.93,0:02:56.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't look back, I only take the ugly for a new one now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.71,0:03:10.36,Main,,0,0,0,,We keep moving
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:14.09,Main,,0,0,0,,We keep it wet and I'm standing still
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.09,0:03:20.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not losing you, I'm somewhere right still
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.07,0:03:26.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Knowing the ending, I know I don't need to see it through
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.29,0:03:31.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm signing this line up, signing this line up
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:34.02,Main,,0,0,0,,He's calling me to you